  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1499780609}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8cc719c69d4466045bebbd37a0c48cc3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueIndex: 0
  textComplete: 0
  dialogueComplete: 0
  textArea: {fileID: 2047150438}
  dialogueTexts:
  - Now on to your primary power.
  - Your 'one trick'... a donkey's bray.
  - It is well-known in the equestrian world how powerful a well trained donkey's
    voice can be.
  - The louder you bray the more force you will project onto your enemies.
  - However, there are times where your voice will be against you when silence is
    necessary - so bray carefully.
  - Try braying at these boxes.
