  dialogueComplete: 0
  textArea: {fileID: 2047150438}
  dialogueTexts:
  - When you must be silent and sneaky, you'll need to be able to crouch.
  - Crouching makes you a lot slower, but it creates no noise.
  - Press (left) CONTROL to crouch.
