  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8cc719c69d4466045bebbd37a0c48cc3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueIndex: 0
  textComplete: 0
  dialogueComplete: 0
  textArea: {fileID: 2047150438}
  dialogueTexts:
  - Welcome new recruit...
  - To the Donkey Secret Agency (DSA)
  - You have been selected to aid us in our long standing war against the disgusting 
    horses.
  - You may wonder why we are at war?
  - It is for hay.
  - We, the donkeys, must have all the hay, but the horses are greedy.
  - However, they are armed with Strategic Impact Tactical Horseshoes (SITH)
  - Unfortunately, us, the donkeys, are only armed with our own voices,
  - Our brays.
  - Go...
  - Bray for Hay
  - (after I teach you how to get stuff done)
