--- !u!114 &1873428797
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1873428794}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8cc719c69d4466045bebbd37a0c48cc3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueIndex: 0
  textComplete: 0
  dialogueComplete: 0
  textArea: {fileID: 2047150438}
  dialogueTexts:
  - On your missions you will generally encounter two types of horses.
  - Firstly, the horse of sight. This horse is quite deaf so can only see you. It
    is also very light so you can easily send it away.
  - Secondly, the horse of hearing. This horse is blind, but has very adept ears
    to hear you, it is quite heavy however so you can't send it away.
  - You'll need to stay out of sight of the sight enemies while remaining silent
    to avoid hearing enemies.
  - There will however be times where you need to use your voice to send away a sight
    horse - in this instance be wary of the hearing horses.
  - Good luck... their arrangements can make it very tricky.
